          "continuity": {
            "verdict": "pass",
            "notes": "A closer camera cut keeps both faces, arms and the packet visible. Luma replies while Milo reacts. The shared hold covers the ownership change; the packet follows Luma after release. I compared the adjacent endpoint images and both scene storyboards. Required costume, scale and ownership continuity is retained. The garden move is an explicit place/time edit, not a claim of continuous world position from the exit.",
